{"words": [{"text": "فَٱذْكُرُونِىٓ", "translation": "So remember Me"}, {"text": "أَذْكُرْكُمْ", "translation": "I will remember you"}, {"text": "وَٱشْكُرُوا۟", "translation": "and be grateful"}, {"text": "لِى", "translation": "to Me"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and (do) not"}, {"text": "تَكْفُرُونِ", "translation": "(be) ungrateful to Me"}], "sahih": "So remember Me; I will remember you. And be grateful to Me and do not deny Me."}